### Interactive Tooltip

_Auto-tested via Playwright._

- All user-interaction (Mouse/Touch/Keyboard) deactivation `activeChange` **MUST** be prevented.
- Clicking the "Clear" button (setState) **MUST** clear the activation.
- Chart resize:
    - Hover over a bar with the Mouse.
    - Press the "S" key on the Keyboard.
    - The chart resizes; the highlight **MUST** redraw correctly.

{% chartExampleRunner
    title="Interactive Tooltip and preventDefault"
    name="interactive-tooltip-example"
/%}

### preventDefault

_Auto-tested via Playwright._

When `preventDefault` is ticked:

- Series Area Mouse/Keyboard interactions **MUST NOT** show Highlight.
- Series Area Mouse/Keyboard interactions **MUST NOT** show Tooltip.
- Legend Mouse/Keyboard interactions **MUST NOT** update Highlight.
- Series Area/Legend Keyboard interactions **MUST** show Focus Indicator.
- Legend Mouse/Keyboard click **MUST** update Series Visibility.

{% chartExampleRunner
    title="Prevent Default Test"
    name="map-prevent-default"
    type="generated"
/%}

